# AskNavidrome needs the plain password of the Navidrome user `alexa`: it
# builds every stream URL Amazon fetches as Subsonic token auth, with a fresh
# salt and t=md5(password+salt) per track, so a precomputed token won't work.
# The skill ID comes from the Alexa Developer Console (Build -> Endpoint); the
# service refuses to start without it.
#
# Don't edit this file by hand. Create the encrypted file with the command in
# docs/en/12-asknavidrome-alexa.md, so the password never lands on disk unencrypted.
---
apiVersion: v1
kind: Secret
metadata:
  name: asknavidrome
  namespace: asknavidrome
stringData:
  NAVI_PASS: "REPLACE_ME"
  NAVI_SKILL_ID: "amzn1.ask.skill.REPLACE_ME"
